{"2007430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blast Cats", "steam_appid": 2007430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Cats</strong> is a love letter to classic 3D platformers! Bomb your enemies to smithereens and smash 'em flat with your mighty Hammer! Find precious gems as you run and jump through secret worlds. Fight powerful foes and show them who’s boss! Adventure explodes unto the world, hang in there baby!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY SO FAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expedition into an ancient tomb awakens a powerful wish granting genie, and all hell breaks loose! Take control of C.C, the pink cat with a knack for explosions, as she tries to undo the evil genie’s curse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAVE A BLAST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chuck Bombs at your foes and blow them to pieces! Launch devastating missile attacks with homing Fireworks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/df2b435d0611b637e20567890406f321.poster.avif?t=1770817971\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/df2b435d0611b637e20567890406f321.webm?t=1770817971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/df2b435d0611b637e20567890406f321.mp4?t=1770817971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SWING THE HAMMER DOWN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squash enemies flat with your trusty Hammer! Activate switches and destroy obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/e28de6bd0d6ffe4d04bdc7ff3dd7d699.poster.avif?t=1770817971\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/e28de6bd0d6ffe4d04bdc7ff3dd7d699.webm?t=1770817971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/e28de6bd0d6ffe4d04bdc7ff3dd7d699.mp4?t=1770817971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEST YOUR METAL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn crazy demolition techniques to dominate the competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/45473283a9649714d85f8c70f392934e.poster.avif?t=1770817971\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/45473283a9649714d85f8c70f392934e.webm?t=1770817971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/45473283a9649714d85f8c70f392934e.mp4?t=1770817971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER SECRET BONUS LEVELS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through the sky using your own explosions! Break the speed of sound behind the wheel of a slick rally car! Take a stroll high above the clouds! Anything can happen in these secret worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/fb91a1b79992215d3108bdf57d8e65d7.poster.avif?t=1770817971\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/fb91a1b79992215d3108bdf57d8e65d7.webm?t=1770817971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/fb91a1b79992215d3108bdf57d8e65d7.mp4?t=1770817971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Dangerous Foes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenging bosses and show off your blasting style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/e420906956333f122494d12784b22b5f.poster.avif?t=1770817971\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/e420906956333f122494d12784b22b5f.webm?t=1770817971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007430/extras/e420906956333f122494d12784b22b5f.mp4?t=1770817971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Low Poly Aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Boss Fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Bonus Zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jammin' Techno Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb Jumping!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Cats</strong> is a love letter to classic 3D platformers! Bomb your enemies to smithereens and smash 'em flat with your mighty Hammer! Find precious gems as you run and jump through secret worlds. Fight powerful foes and show them who’s boss! Adventure explodes unto the world, hang in there baby!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY SO FAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expedition into an ancient tomb awakens a powerful wish granting genie, and all hell breaks loose! Take control of C.C, the pink cat with a knack for 